              "claim": "Put $B:=K_0^{-1}V$. The coefficient of $z^n$ in $S$ is $(-B)^nK_0^{-1}$, a finite matrix, so the series defines an element of $M_d(\\mathbb C\\llbracket z\\rrbracket)$ without an analytic convergence assumption.",
