              "id": "derive-1-2",
              "step": "1.2",
              "claim": "Each link block transforms as $T_e\\zeta_e^\\theta=e^{i\\theta_{s(e)}}(T_e\\zeta_e)e^{-i\\theta_{t(e)}}$; summing links in each block gives $V(\\zeta^\\theta)=D_\\theta V(\\zeta)D_\\theta^{-1}$. With [A1], the assumed covariance of $K_0$ gives the same conjugation for each coefficient of $K$; [F3] supplies the separate continuum phase convention, without identifying graph vertices with spacetime points.",
