        "statement": "For two channels in $\\mathbb R^2$, let $\\nu_1=(1,-1)$, $d_1=-2$, $\\nu_2=(-1,1)$, and $d_2=1$. No offset $b\\in\\mathbb R^2$ satisfies both $b\\cdot\\nu_a+d_a\\ge0$.",
